Three Edwards 1978 Table 7 anchors miss their bands since water's Psat moved to IAPWS (2026-11-16): y_CO2aq row1 0.5034->0.5081 vs cited 0.494 (band 0.025), P row2 1.9188->1.8957 vs 1.98 (band 0.04), P row3 1.9063->1.8834 vs 1.97 (band 0.04); a Psat-only control moves exactly these, but the paper's gap grew (3.1/3.2 % -> 4.3/4.4 %), so Psat does not explain it and no band was widened; see docs/audits/2026-11-16-water-psat-moved-goldens.md "Open after this landing".
